    "description": {
      "value": "This small doll has been carved from a fragment of Bloodstone. When you Activate a bloodstone doll in response to another's magic, you Interact to take it in hand and hold it up toward the triggering creature. Attempt a counteract check against the triggering spell at the listed bonus and rank. If the spell would be counteracted, the bloodstone doll instead influences the summoned creature. You gain control of the summoned creature and can dictate its 2 actions for that turn. The triggering creature then regains control of their summoned creature, but the summoned creature takes a \u20132 status penalty to attack rolls against you. Your bloodstone doll shatters when the summon spell ends. The bloodstone doll has a counteract modifier of +9 and a counteract rank of 2."
    },
